[worker]    * **`browser-use`**: Web automation framework for complex task-driven web interactions.
[worker]    * **`firecrawl` suite**: Comprehensive scraping, search, deep research, and interaction toolchain (`firecrawl-scrape`, `firecrawl-interact`, `firecrawl-search`, `firecrawl-crawl`).
